[01:00.16] Ah am imezran
[01:03.31]
[01:21.34] Ma mazal abruy n ṣṣwab
[01:24.63] Qbel ad yebbuṛket leɛtab
[01:27.67] Ad nerret azal i tmusni
[01:30.59] Ma tqeddereḍ azekka nɣab
[01:33.54] Tallit fell-aɣ tenneqlab
[01:36.48] Aẓaṛ n ccetla ad yefti
[01:39.23] D lesnin yecceḍ-aɣ leḥsab
[01:42.54] S yir awal nettemğawab
[01:45.61] I tegmat i d-nesɣimi
[01:48.32] Ass-a m-id yeɣli rrebrab
[01:51.59] D lawan ad nemjarab
[01:54.62] Ad neɛqlet wid aɣ-yecqan
[01:57.13] Ah am imezran
[02:00.11]
[02:18.31] Init-d amek ara nkemmel
[02:21.13] Abrid imi nedderɣel
[02:24.00] A wid ifeṛẓen timsal
[02:27.09] Iyyaw kan ad tt-nfeṣṣel
[02:30.09] S tmusni ad tt-nbeddel
[02:32.90] Ad nṛebbi afud i lɛeqqal
[02:35.99] Ma neğğa-tt akka terkel
[02:38.75] Ad s-nenḥedder ad ten-nenṭel
[02:42.01] S ddɣel ad aɣ-d-yerjem wakal
[02:44.89] Ma neddukel s Leqbayel
[02:47.82] Ad yifsus fell-aneɣ cɣel
[02:50.81] Azekka ad aɣ-d-ḍṣen wussan
[02:53.65] Ah am imezran
[02:56.48]
[03:14.15] Si leqdim n zzman akka
[03:17.35] Taluft ur d-nesteqsa
[03:20.31] D abrid urɛad i tufi
[03:23.36] Xas mazal ad d-nemsawa
[03:26.20] Ad nefres abrid i uzekka
[03:29.13] I tarwa ma ad d-tennerni
[03:32.13] Taɛṛabt ur tesɛi lfayda
[03:34.94] Ɣer lisser ur tenğir targa
[03:37.90] Ur tesnernay di tmusni
[03:40.78] Ansa iɣ-d-fɣent lwafaɛ
[03:43.84] Yesnusuyen itran ass-a
[03:46.86] Si lakul n Lezzayer iḥfan
